es care of the administrative registration or re-registration of PSL PhD students carrying out their thesis at Chimie ParisTech.\nThe general registration procedure that needs to be followed on the platform can be found on the website.\nAdmissions\nEngineering cycle admissions\nMaster\u2019s admissions\nPhD admissions\nInternational candidates\nCONTACT\nOffice of the Research Secretariat\nReception by appointment\nOpening hours: Monday to Friday, 10 am to 5 pm\nInfo on administrative procedure\nRegister as a PSL PhD student via ADUM\nRe-register as a PSL PhD student via ADUM\nGuide for creating an account on ADUM\nProcedure for PhD thesis defense\nChimie ParisTech - PSL, France\u2019s leading engineering school specializing in chemistry\nChimie ParisTech - PSL has been training chemical and general engineers for the past 120 years. Its founder, Charles Friedel, wanted future chemical entrepreneurs to be trained in contact with research while in college. Chimie ParisTech - PSL therefore hosts a research center that is active and recognized in various fields of chemistry: materials, processes, chemistry for the living, molecular chemistry and covers fields such as health, energy, environment and mobility\nChimie et sant\u00e9\nChimie et environnement\nChimie et \u00e9nergie\nChimie et mat\u00e9riaux\nIntranet\nLocation d\u2019espaces\nMarch\u00e9s publics\nAcc\u00e8s & Contact\nMentions l\u00e9gales\nPolitique de confidentialit\u00e9\nPlan du site\nChimie ParisTech - PSL- 11, rue Pierre et Marie Curie - 75231 PARIS Cedex 05 - FRANCE - Ph.: 011 33 1 44 27 66 72 - Fax: 011 33 1 43 29 20 59\n\u00a9 2026 Chimie ParisTech - PSL- All rights reserved\nGDPR Cookie Banner\nWe are using cookies to give you the best experience on our website.\nYou can find out more about which cookies we are using or switch them off in settings.\nAccept\nScroll To Top\nClose GDPR Cookie Settings\nPrivacy Overview\nStrictly Necessary Cookies\nAnalytics\nCookie Policy\nPowered by GDPR Cookie Compl